WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:36.475
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:36.745 --> 02:38.785
What did No. 331 say to you?

3
02:38.865 --> 02:40.065
Why did you come here?

4
02:40.625 --> 02:41.505
I was replaced.

5
02:41.585 --> 02:43.265
No. 331 forfeited midway through.

6
02:43.345 --> 02:44.505
Do you know that?

7
02:47.145 --> 02:49.345
No. 331 ran 4.5 laps before forfeiting.

8
02:49.425 --> 02:50.665
On the third lap,

9
02:50.745 --> 02:52.305
No. 323 and No. 308 lapped her.

10
02:52.385 --> 02:54.585
323 LI ZHENG, 308 ZHENG YU, 331 TONG RUYI

11
02:55.265 --> 02:56.305
Are you sure?

12
02:56.385 --> 02:58.225
No. 331 said she finished.

13
02:58.305 --> 03:00.145
Would she dare lie to a referee?

14
03:00.225 --> 03:01.265
I'm sure.

15
03:01.345 --> 03:03.305
No. 308 was the second finisher.

16
03:03.385 --> 03:05.985
You can ask for an explanation or check surveillance.

17
03:08.305 --> 03:09.825
ZHENG YU, RANKING

18
03:13.225 --> 03:14.505
Is that true?

19
03:18.305 --> 03:19.465
RUNNING RESULTS

20
03:19.545 --> 03:20.505
EVENT: 1500 M

21
03:20.585 --> 03:21.585
ZHENG YU

22
03:21.665 --> 03:25.065
Did the junior women's 1500 m also take place today?

23
03:25.145 --> 03:25.985
Yes.

24
03:26.065 --> 03:28.465
Immediately after it was the men's 3000 m,

25
03:28.545 --> 03:30.065
then the women's 3000 m now.

26
03:44.585 --> 03:45.545
What's the problem?

27
03:46.625 --> 03:47.505
I just ran.

28
03:48.865 --> 03:51.025
I'm nauseous and want to vomit.

29
03:51.945 --> 03:54.025
If it's not serious, just go back and rest.

30
03:54.105 --> 03:54.945
It's serious.

31
03:59.545 --> 04:01.225
How many meters did you run?

32
04:01.305 --> 04:02.225
The 3000 m.

33
04:02.305 --> 04:03.745
And the 1500 m.

34
04:03.825 --> 04:06.745
Do students this year have to be so enthusiastic?

35
04:06.825 --> 04:09.745
He even has bruises from running.

36
04:11.425 --> 04:15.345
Do you have omeprazole or mosapride capsules?

37
04:15.425 --> 04:16.265
Either will do.

38
04:17.025 --> 04:18.425
Are you in the College of Medicine?

39
04:18.504 --> 04:19.745
Life Sciences.

40
04:22.745 --> 04:23.865
Register first.

41
04:24.385 --> 04:26.905
Follow the instructions for the usage and dosage.

42
04:26.985 --> 04:28.145
Okay.

43
04:32.265 --> 04:34.345
That's probably heatstroke.

44
04:34.425 --> 04:35.865
Move him into the shade.

45
04:35.945 --> 04:37.265
Okay, I'll be right there.

46
04:39.345 --> 04:41.665
-You can go after that. -Thank you, miss.

47
04:50.585 --> 04:54.225
ZHENG YU

48
05:16.905 --> 05:18.105
Zheng Yu?

49
05:35.425 --> 05:36.265
How do you feel?

50
05:38.545 --> 05:39.385
Great.

51
05:39.985 --> 05:41.105
Then why are you here?

52
05:44.905 --> 05:46.265
I left right afterward.

53
05:46.345 --> 05:48.225
I didn't see my result.

54
05:49.745 --> 05:50.585
Am I second?

55
05:51.985 --> 05:53.025
Yes.

56
05:53.105 --> 05:54.465
In the final sprint,

57
05:54.545 --> 05:56.865
No. 323 nearly lapped you.

58
06:05.105 --> 06:06.625
Who is

59
06:06.705 --> 06:08.145
your box of medicine for?

60
06:10.865 --> 06:12.745
Given your health condition,

61
06:12.825 --> 06:15.025
you have no chance of running long-distance.

62
06:15.705 --> 06:18.025
What? Are you saving it for yourself?

63
06:19.025 --> 06:20.425
I…

64
06:21.465 --> 06:22.585
As a volunteer,

65
06:23.305 --> 06:25.145
I got it for athletes who need it.

66
06:25.825 --> 06:27.665
Since you're fine, I'm leaving.

67
07:04.425 --> 07:05.425
How

68
07:06.185 --> 07:07.665
will you return to the dorm?

69
07:08.905 --> 07:09.945
It's on my way.

70
07:11.265 --> 07:12.625
I can take you with that.

71
07:13.265 --> 07:14.865
Consider it volunteer duties.

72
07:17.505 --> 07:18.745
My legs aren't crippled.

73
07:19.745 --> 07:22.105
Think of it as a means of transportation.

74
07:22.825 --> 07:23.665
No.

75
07:27.905 --> 07:28.745
Fine.

76
07:29.625 --> 07:30.745
Then rest here.

77
07:31.345 --> 07:33.105
Your time isn't worth much anyway.

78
07:33.625 --> 07:34.705
It's fine to waste it.

79
07:45.905 --> 07:47.985
It's your time that isn't worth much.

80
08:23.185 --> 08:25.465
I can understand studying like crazy.

81
08:25.545 --> 08:28.625
But going all out for a sports meet in junior year?

82
08:29.225 --> 08:30.545
I can't figure out why.

83
08:31.145 --> 08:32.065
It's to

84
08:32.144 --> 08:33.904
keep fit.

85
08:36.985 --> 08:38.825
You don't think you're funny, do you?

86
08:39.825 --> 08:41.545
I'm saying this as your classmate.

87
08:42.385 --> 08:44.144
Save your energy for studying.

88
08:44.225 --> 08:47.065
Otherwise, if I end up winning the Vitality Award,

89
08:47.145 --> 08:48.825
I will feel that I won unfairly.

90
08:54.385 --> 08:55.225
Hello?

91
08:55.305 --> 08:56.545
I contacted No. 331.

92
08:56.625 --> 08:59.305
She admitted that she lied impulsively.

93
08:59.905 --> 09:02.305
Forfeiting results in no score. That's it.

94
09:02.385 --> 09:04.825
Where are you? I need you and Zhang Qi to sign.

95
09:05.945 --> 09:07.465
Got it. I'll be right there.

96
09:10.065 --> 09:10.945
I'll be okay.

97
09:12.985 --> 09:15.345
Do you know how to use this wheelchair?

98
09:21.345 --> 09:22.625
I'm familiar with them.

99
09:23.945 --> 09:26.465
An old leg injury?

100
09:27.505 --> 09:28.585
Then why did you race?

101
09:29.185 --> 09:30.785
I didn't need one myself.

102
09:30.865 --> 09:32.265
I've watched others use them.

103
09:33.825 --> 09:35.025
Who?

104
09:39.865 --> 09:41.105
Who else?

105
09:41.185 --> 09:43.705
People who were injured

106
09:43.785 --> 09:44.785
and bedridden.

107
09:46.625 --> 09:47.505
Wait.

108
09:48.265 --> 09:49.505
You know how to use it.

109
09:50.705 --> 09:51.705
You said nothing.

110
09:53.145 --> 09:56.065
You said you wanted to fulfill your volunteer duties.

111
09:56.145 --> 09:58.145
I couldn't interfere with your work.

112
10:17.065 --> 10:18.625
Zheng Yu, your feet!

113
10:19.505 --> 10:21.585
-I'm fine. -We'll help you upstairs.

114
10:22.345 --> 10:23.185
No, thanks.

115
10:28.305 --> 10:29.385
We're going to go.

116
10:29.465 --> 10:30.385
Be careful.

117
10:37.785 --> 10:38.665
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

118
10:38.745 --> 10:39.585
Fangli.

119
10:40.145 --> 10:41.585
Why did you leave so quickly?

120
10:42.345 --> 10:44.345
I said I wanted us to bond as roommates

121
10:44.425 --> 10:47.025
and roped you guys into giving her the shoes.

122
10:47.105 --> 10:48.865
You all got humiliated with me.

123
10:48.945 --> 10:50.705
What was humiliating about it?

124
10:50.785 --> 10:53.625
Maybe Zheng Yu just thought that the shoes were too expensive.

125
10:53.705 --> 10:55.585
Didn't you say they were sold out?

126
10:55.665 --> 10:57.545
She could have explained that to me.

127
10:58.745 --> 11:01.265
Anyway, if she ignores me, I will ignore her.

128
11:01.345 --> 11:03.145
Let's go get food.

129
11:35.265 --> 11:38.425
THE PRIZE MONEY FROM TODAY'S SPORTS MEET HAS BEEN SENT.

130
11:45.705 --> 11:47.985
Stop shaking it. Ma'am, that's enough.

131
11:48.065 --> 11:48.905
Hello.

132
11:48.985 --> 11:49.945
ATHLETE MEAL VOUCHER

133
11:50.585 --> 11:52.185
Pick two meats and a vegetable.

134
11:52.785 --> 11:54.105
-This. -This.

135
11:54.185 --> 11:55.265
And this.

136
12:09.305 --> 12:11.225
I've never seen you at the cafeteria.

137
12:14.025 --> 12:14.865
Except once.

138
12:16.665 --> 12:19.025
Are you back to volunteer again today?

139
12:20.585 --> 12:23.585
I came to campus today to go to the lab.

140
12:28.265 --> 12:29.465
And on the way…

141
12:33.825 --> 12:34.665
Your medals.

142
12:35.305 --> 12:37.665
I grabbed them when I went back to sign.

143
12:50.225 --> 12:51.985
Are you Zheng Yu, in Life Sciences?

144
12:52.065 --> 12:53.385
I'm not wrong, am I?

145
12:53.985 --> 12:55.425
Hello, I'm Tang Chenbin.

146
12:55.505 --> 12:57.545
I'm doing an English major.

147
12:58.145 --> 13:00.145
I saw you in the 3000 m race yesterday.

148
13:04.825 --> 13:05.785
What are these?

149
13:05.865 --> 13:07.345
Did you run the 1500 m too?

150
13:07.425 --> 13:08.265
You're amazing!

151
13:09.905 --> 13:10.865
You have no idea.

152
13:10.945 --> 13:12.465
I was going to sign up to run,

153
13:12.545 --> 13:15.945
but I was busy working on my thesis and finding a summer internship,

154
13:16.025 --> 13:17.665
and had no time to train.

155
13:18.265 --> 13:20.105
Anyway, when I saw you yesterday,

156
13:20.185 --> 13:21.705
I regretted not signing up.

157
13:21.785 --> 13:23.225
After all, it's my last meet.

158
13:23.305 --> 13:24.945
-This-- -Do you need something?

159
13:30.745 --> 13:31.745
No.

160
13:31.825 --> 13:32.665
Well…

161
13:33.225 --> 13:34.625
I said so much.

162
13:34.705 --> 13:36.665
Can't you tell that I'm hitting on you?

163
13:43.225 --> 13:44.145
Well…

164
13:46.465 --> 13:48.145
Can I add you on WeChat?

165
14:09.785 --> 14:10.625
I'm going to go.

166
14:12.625 --> 14:15.585
I'll send you my info. Talk to you on WeChat later. Bye.

167
14:20.905 --> 14:21.745
Talk about what?

168
14:22.345 --> 14:23.865
About how to run a marathon?

169
14:32.865 --> 14:33.705
TANG CHENBIN

170
14:33.785 --> 14:35.785
Zheng Yu, are you free this weekend?

171
14:36.385 --> 14:39.505
There's a maker's market near campus. Want to go together?

172
14:39.585 --> 14:43.265
How are the edits going on that paper you worked on with Ms. Cheng?

173
14:43.345 --> 14:45.505
I want to submit it to Molecular Plant,

174
14:45.585 --> 14:47.345
but my English is limited.

175
14:47.425 --> 14:49.345
I will need help with the translation.

176
14:51.145 --> 14:52.985
Find someone you know.

177
14:53.065 --> 14:55.265
If you find some random person online,

178
14:55.345 --> 14:56.785
they could leak the paper.

179
14:57.505 --> 14:58.825
Someone I know

180
14:58.905 --> 15:01.425
who is fluent in English and knowledgeable about biology

181
15:02.585 --> 15:03.625
is hard to find.

182
15:09.225 --> 15:11.185
I can think of one person.

183
15:12.025 --> 15:12.865
Who?

184
15:13.465 --> 15:15.745
TANG CHENBIN TRANSLATION AND EDITING RATES

185
15:18.945 --> 15:20.345
This is my side gig.

186
15:20.425 --> 15:22.305
Aren't you a senior?

187
15:22.905 --> 15:24.905
If you or your classmates need help,

188
15:24.985 --> 15:26.345
feel free to contact me.

189
15:26.425 --> 15:28.625
The revisions will be to your satisfaction.

190
15:35.505 --> 15:36.585
Are you kidding me?

191
15:38.985 --> 15:39.825
Zheng Yu?

192
15:40.625 --> 15:41.785
Forget it.

193
15:42.465 --> 15:44.425
You have a paper to revise

194
15:44.505 --> 15:45.825
and the Excellence Cup,

195
15:45.905 --> 15:48.505
not to mention all the course assignments.

196
15:48.585 --> 15:50.585
It's clearly a win-win collaboration.

197
15:50.665 --> 15:52.785
Why do you insist on going at it alone?

198
15:52.865 --> 15:54.465
You'll just end up like you did last time.

199
15:56.145 --> 15:58.145
Counting the weekend and the Sports Meet,

200
15:58.225 --> 15:59.785
you had five days off.

201
16:00.785 --> 16:03.265
Everyone seems to have "post-holiday syndrome."

202
16:03.345 --> 16:04.865
You need something to kick you into gear.

203
16:04.945 --> 16:06.425
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING LECTURER: XU KE

204
16:06.505 --> 16:08.065
This semester's group project

205
16:08.145 --> 16:09.905
has been posted.

206
16:13.785 --> 16:15.905
For this class, besides attendance,

207
16:15.985 --> 16:19.105
your grade will depend on this assignment.

208
16:20.385 --> 16:22.105
We have 15 minutes left.

209
16:22.185 --> 16:24.665
Find your group and decide how to split the work.

210
16:24.745 --> 16:25.865
Get to it.

211
16:33.785 --> 16:34.985
Zheng Yu,

212
16:35.065 --> 16:36.065
where is your group?

213
16:36.665 --> 16:37.505
Playing hooky?

214
16:38.905 --> 16:41.465
DID YOU SEE THE ASSIGNMENT? WHEN SHOULD WE MEET?

215
16:45.225 --> 16:48.745
We should research extension topics before the next class.

216
16:56.585 --> 16:58.785
SUN DONGCHAO: STILL NEED MORE GAINS

217
17:10.464 --> 17:11.905
Someone said they work solo,

218
17:11.985 --> 17:14.424
but in the end, they still had to team up.

219
17:15.145 --> 17:17.625
And you? Didn't Xu Ke assign you to a team?

220
17:18.305 --> 17:19.665
I came back from leave.

221
17:19.745 --> 17:21.424
I don't want to hold others back.

222
17:22.905 --> 17:26.385
Use the rest of the time in today's class for group discussions.

223
17:31.265 --> 17:33.985
Zheng Yu, this is the information I gathered.

224
17:40.305 --> 17:43.905
Besides literature, I also found videos, so the files are large.

225
17:54.825 --> 17:56.945
I could have sworn I put the files there.

226
18:03.025 --> 18:04.785
Sun Dongchao, where are your files?

227
18:05.665 --> 18:07.225
I didn't do it.

228
18:07.305 --> 18:08.545
Why do we need so many?

229
18:08.625 --> 18:10.145
Wang Siyun's files are enough.

230
18:10.225 --> 18:12.905
What's up with you? Zheng Yu and I can't do everything.

231
18:13.505 --> 18:14.785
Let's pick a topic first.

232
18:14.865 --> 18:16.585
Here are my library books.

233
18:16.665 --> 18:18.185
Fine, I know.

234
18:18.265 --> 18:20.425
I have stuff to do later. I have to go.

235
18:20.505 --> 18:21.545
You guys can decide.

236
18:25.905 --> 18:27.145
This is too obvious.

237
18:27.225 --> 18:28.825
I'll leave my backpack here.

238
18:28.905 --> 18:30.625
Bring it to my dorm after class.

239
18:30.705 --> 18:32.185
Just leave it at the entrance.

240
18:32.265 --> 18:33.265
We're not done yet.

241
18:33.345 --> 18:35.185
Don't be a pain. Just help me out.

242
18:35.265 --> 18:36.665
-Fifty yuan. -Are you broke?

243
18:41.265 --> 18:43.345
I have partnered with others before.

244
18:43.425 --> 18:44.945
But every time,

245
18:45.025 --> 18:46.345
my partner

246
18:46.425 --> 18:47.665
was a burden to me.

247
19:05.825 --> 19:07.265
Can you be more cooperative?

248
19:07.345 --> 19:08.985
This is a group assignment.

249
19:09.065 --> 19:11.425
If you keep this up, you will piss Zheng Yu off.

250
19:11.505 --> 19:13.505
If she's angry, nobody will do the work.

251
19:14.185 --> 19:15.465
Take a leaf out of my book.

252
19:15.545 --> 19:17.225
Throw together some information

253
19:17.305 --> 19:19.105
and sit back and get a high score.

254
19:19.185 --> 19:20.945
There's nothing to worry about.

255
19:21.025 --> 19:22.865
Xu Ke specified groups of three.

256
19:22.945 --> 19:24.865
Zheng Yu will have to deal with it.

257
19:24.945 --> 19:25.945
Besides, you and I…

258
19:27.825 --> 19:28.905
Let's talk over there.

259
19:35.185 --> 19:36.025
You'll take that?

260
19:38.865 --> 19:39.825
I'm used to it.

261
19:50.025 --> 19:51.545
GENE TRANSMISSION

262
19:51.625 --> 19:54.025
JUNIOR HIGH SCHOOL BIOLOGY PRACTICE EXAMS

263
19:59.185 --> 20:01.585
The presentation is due before next week's class.

264
20:01.665 --> 20:04.385
You can submit the summary before you present in class.

265
20:05.945 --> 20:08.745
WANG SIYUN: OK

266
20:23.025 --> 20:24.825
UNKNOWN NUMBER

267
20:28.305 --> 20:30.185
Hello? Who is it?

268
20:30.265 --> 20:32.105
I'm outside your dorm building.

269
20:32.185 --> 20:33.665
I want to talk to you.

270
20:48.625 --> 20:50.905
-What is it? -Xie Yudi is looking for you.

271
20:50.985 --> 20:52.625
He said he will wait outside.

272
20:52.705 --> 20:54.585
Maybe you should go see him.

273
20:54.665 --> 20:55.745
Sorry, I'm busy.

274
21:05.585 --> 21:08.505
There's a guy downstairs who said he can't reach you.

275
21:08.585 --> 21:10.145
-He wants to see you. -Leave it.

276
21:11.505 --> 21:12.345
I already said…

277
21:13.105 --> 21:14.145
What's wrong?

278
21:15.025 --> 21:16.025
It's nothing.

279
21:23.505 --> 21:25.985
I ran into Xie Yudi downstairs just now.

280
21:26.065 --> 21:28.905
He said he would keep waiting for you.

281
21:28.985 --> 21:31.585
If you don't see him, he might keep sending people.

282
21:31.665 --> 21:33.945
Then the whole building will know.

283
21:42.585 --> 21:43.785
What is it?

284
21:45.985 --> 21:48.865
Sun Dongchao is going around saying you're a pushover.

285
21:48.945 --> 21:49.985
Do you know that?

286
21:50.625 --> 21:52.345
If that's all, I'm going to go.

287
21:52.945 --> 21:56.425
He can do no work in your group and still get a high score.

288
21:56.505 --> 21:57.665
Change groups.

289
22:00.065 --> 22:00.905
It's not your concern.

290
22:02.945 --> 22:03.785
I'm helping you.

291
22:03.865 --> 22:05.305
Wang Chao is also a slacker.

292
22:05.385 --> 22:06.825
I'll kick him out. Join us.

293
22:06.905 --> 22:07.865
No need.

294
22:28.025 --> 22:29.505
I just saw this.

295
22:29.585 --> 22:30.545
Forget it.

296
22:30.625 --> 22:33.145
I'm already swamped with graduation requirements.

297
22:33.225 --> 22:35.345
Don't send translation gigs to me.

298
22:35.425 --> 22:38.345
Graduating earlier will save me a fortune.

299
22:38.425 --> 22:40.745
I thought I could finish in three years.

300
22:40.825 --> 22:43.585
Nearly four years in, graduation isn't even in sight!

301
22:43.665 --> 22:44.945
QIN SIZHI

302
22:45.025 --> 22:47.225
I must've been crazy to study in Germany.

303
22:48.345 --> 22:49.505
Are you back at university?

304
22:49.585 --> 22:51.185
Are you doing better now?

305
22:58.105 --> 23:01.625
ZHENG YU

306
23:01.705 --> 23:03.505
Genetics problems look complicated,

307
23:03.585 --> 23:04.905
but there's a trick to it.

308
23:04.985 --> 23:07.385
Start by drawing a genetic diagram,

309
23:07.465 --> 23:09.905
and identify the parents and their children.

310
23:14.665 --> 23:15.585
Keep going.

311
23:16.745 --> 23:20.545
Now, try to determine whether this trait is dominant or recessive.

312
23:23.065 --> 23:25.065
Is that your boyfriend?

313
23:26.225 --> 23:27.425
Focus on the problem.

314
23:28.025 --> 23:29.785
Just send a reply.

315
23:29.865 --> 23:31.145
I'm tutoring you.

316
23:31.745 --> 23:33.385
What if they can't reach you

317
23:33.465 --> 23:34.745
and keep calling you?

318
23:35.585 --> 23:37.265
Won't that interrupt us?

319
23:42.785 --> 23:44.305
CHEN YANZHOU

320
23:44.385 --> 23:45.505
Are you on campus?

321
23:46.145 --> 23:47.265
I need to talk to you.

322
23:49.305 --> 23:50.345
I'm not.

323
23:50.425 --> 23:52.665
I'll be at the convenience store later.

324
23:55.625 --> 23:56.505
What time?

325
23:58.065 --> 23:59.145
Around 5:30 p.m.

326
24:01.665 --> 24:02.905
Playing on your phone?

327
24:02.985 --> 24:04.745
Is this how you waste time?

328
24:04.825 --> 24:05.825
No, Mom, it was me--

329
24:05.905 --> 24:07.265
Be quiet.

330
24:08.185 --> 24:10.865
Zheng Yu, I hire you by the hour.

331
24:10.945 --> 24:13.385
Every minute that you waste costs money.

332
24:28.305 --> 24:30.625
I can extend the lesson by 10 minutes today.

333
24:30.705 --> 24:31.985
Is that acceptable?

334
24:36.945 --> 24:38.385
I'll let it slide this time.

335
24:38.465 --> 24:40.025
Don't do it again.

336
24:43.745 --> 24:44.865
I'll check your work.

337
25:01.625 --> 25:04.385
WHAT TIME?

338
25:20.065 --> 25:22.785
AROUND 5:30 P.M.

339
25:30.265 --> 25:33.065
CHEN YANZHOU

340
26:01.545 --> 26:03.385
You're early today.

341
26:23.025 --> 26:24.785
Do you see that boy over there?

342
26:25.505 --> 26:28.025
He sat here for three hours and didn't buy a thing.

343
26:28.105 --> 26:29.945
Is this a free study room?

344
26:33.305 --> 26:34.585
Take care of it.

345
26:34.665 --> 26:35.745
I'm leaving.

346
26:48.905 --> 26:50.305
That's 120 yuan.

347
27:01.625 --> 27:02.585
For you.

348
27:07.105 --> 27:08.785
What do you want? Tell me.

349
27:10.705 --> 27:11.745
I want

350
27:12.305 --> 27:13.145
your help.

351
27:14.505 --> 27:17.585
I have a paper that needs to be translated into English.

352
27:19.105 --> 27:20.865
I'll pay. Name your price.

353
27:22.705 --> 27:23.745
Okay.

354
27:24.505 --> 27:25.385
However,

355
27:25.985 --> 27:27.385
I also need

356
27:28.025 --> 27:29.145
a favor from you.

357
27:31.505 --> 27:32.825
Come in.

358
27:42.105 --> 27:44.505
Sir, I'm Chen Yanzhou in Life Sciences Class 1.

359
27:44.585 --> 27:45.425
What do you need?

360
27:46.025 --> 27:48.345
I was away on medical leave for a year.

361
27:48.425 --> 27:50.385
Now that I'm back,

362
27:50.465 --> 27:52.225
I feel quite a bit behind.

363
27:52.305 --> 27:53.905
I'm catching up too slowly.

364
27:53.985 --> 27:57.665
I want to team up with a classmate for the microbiology project.

365
27:57.745 --> 27:59.545
That is possible,

366
27:59.625 --> 28:02.025
but groups were already formed in that class.

367
28:02.705 --> 28:05.625
If I directly bring in a classmate for you,

368
28:05.705 --> 28:07.345
others might find out you…

369
28:09.305 --> 28:10.545
I'll be in a tough spot.

370
28:12.625 --> 28:13.625
I see.

371
28:15.025 --> 28:16.985
Or you can see

372
28:17.065 --> 28:19.025
if anyone will team up with you.

373
28:19.105 --> 28:21.585
If they agree to it, I won't object.

374
28:23.505 --> 28:24.465
Thank you, sir.

375
28:24.545 --> 28:25.745
I'll ask around.

376
28:25.825 --> 28:26.985
I'll message you later.

377
28:27.065 --> 28:27.985
Okay.

378
28:34.745 --> 28:36.025
MICROBIOLOGY GROUP

379
28:36.105 --> 28:37.145
CHAT DETAILS

380
28:37.225 --> 28:38.545
LEAVE GROUP

381
28:38.625 --> 28:41.425
Why didn't you just explain the situation to the teacher?

382
28:42.745 --> 28:45.145
Xu Ke hates tattletales.

383
28:45.225 --> 28:46.745
When partners don't get along,

384
28:46.825 --> 28:49.825
he will believe that the tattletale is the problem.

385
28:52.145 --> 28:55.185
I just realized you seem to know every teacher well.

386
28:55.265 --> 28:57.745
When Li Yanan paired us up, you could've refused.

387
28:57.825 --> 28:59.225
In the football class,

388
28:59.305 --> 29:01.385
you knew the teacher hates substitutes.

389
29:01.465 --> 29:03.945
Now, you know the microbiology teacher's temper.

390
29:07.345 --> 29:08.345
Know what this is?

391
29:09.945 --> 29:11.625
Cutting off the head of the snake?

392
29:13.665 --> 29:15.265
Biological adaptation.

393
29:19.465 --> 29:20.625
What does this mean?

394
29:20.705 --> 29:21.585
WANG SIYUN

395
29:22.505 --> 29:23.465
Bye.

396
29:30.145 --> 29:30.985
Sir.

397
29:33.425 --> 29:34.945
What's the problem?

398
29:35.025 --> 29:36.665
Zheng Yu just suddenly withdrew!

399
29:36.745 --> 29:38.305
Our assignment was half done.

400
29:38.385 --> 29:40.745
With her gone, we don't have time to start over.

401
29:40.825 --> 29:41.665
Exactly.

402
29:41.745 --> 29:44.665
We worked hard on it together. How could she just leave?

403
29:44.745 --> 29:45.745
I know about this.

404
29:46.385 --> 29:48.105
I approved her withdrawal.

405
29:48.185 --> 29:50.105
Sir, this isn't fair.

406
29:50.185 --> 29:51.225
No, sir.

407
29:51.305 --> 29:53.785
She always carried on and disregarded our opinions.

408
29:53.865 --> 29:56.305
Now she has even taken our work with her.

409
29:57.225 --> 29:58.945
I have spoken to Zheng Yu.

410
29:59.025 --> 30:02.465
She said she won't take your group's work with her.

411
30:03.185 --> 30:05.825
She will start over with other classmates.

412
30:05.905 --> 30:08.505
Sun Dongchao and Wang Siyun, right?

413
30:10.825 --> 30:12.505
I remember you two well.

414
30:12.585 --> 30:14.025
Here, Sun Dongchao.

415
30:14.905 --> 30:17.585
"Absent, absent, left early, absent, absent."

416
30:17.665 --> 30:20.625
In the future, if you're absent one more time,

417
30:20.705 --> 30:23.385
you won't get credit for this class.

418
30:23.465 --> 30:24.825
-Sir, that was-- -Enough.

419
30:25.505 --> 30:27.905
You're usually sleeping in class or absent.

420
30:27.985 --> 30:29.545
Do you think I'm unaware?

421
30:29.625 --> 30:32.145
So far, Zheng Yu has been the only one working

422
30:32.225 --> 30:33.825
on the group assignment, right?

423
30:33.905 --> 30:35.425
I didn't want to interfere.

424
30:35.505 --> 30:38.545
You're all adults, not elementary school kids.

425
30:38.625 --> 30:41.585
I believed you guys could sort it out among yourselves.

426
30:42.185 --> 30:43.465
But now,

427
30:43.545 --> 30:46.225
you're complaining about her and speaking ill of her.

428
30:46.905 --> 30:47.745
Let's do this.

429
30:48.985 --> 30:50.065
You two are a group.

430
30:50.665 --> 30:54.505
Submit your slides and summary to me separately for review.

431
31:06.665 --> 31:08.145
What are you doing?

432
31:08.225 --> 31:09.265
Give it to me.

433
31:15.865 --> 31:17.105
It looks nice.

434
31:20.065 --> 31:20.905
ZHENG YU

435
31:20.985 --> 31:22.065
When are you free?

436
31:22.145 --> 31:24.225
Let's split up the microbiology assignment.

437
31:24.905 --> 31:26.025
Tomorrow morning.

438
31:26.105 --> 31:27.185
Let's go to the library.

439
31:27.945 --> 31:28.905
Okay.

440
31:50.905 --> 31:53.305
Your seat choices sure are unconventional.

441
31:53.905 --> 31:55.105
How will we communicate?

442
31:56.185 --> 31:57.745
The seats next to you

443
31:57.825 --> 31:59.785
were reserved by others.

444
32:00.865 --> 32:03.625
If necessary, we'll communicate on WeChat.

445
32:14.265 --> 32:15.465
Let's leave.

446
32:15.545 --> 32:17.585
There's another place that is available.

447
32:34.825 --> 32:37.105
No one uses this lab anymore.

448
32:37.745 --> 32:39.185
How did you get the key?

449
32:39.945 --> 32:41.425
Did Mr. Li give it to you?

450
32:42.825 --> 32:44.905
What? Suspect that I bribed him again?

451
32:50.145 --> 32:51.865
Mr. Li and my mom are old friends,

452
32:51.945 --> 32:54.265
so he does look after me.

453
32:54.345 --> 32:56.425
But he has always been impartial professionally.

454
32:56.505 --> 32:59.225
If you ask him for the key, he will give it to you too.

455
33:00.305 --> 33:01.945
I didn't say anything.

456
33:10.185 --> 33:11.305
Come in.

457
33:31.505 --> 33:33.865
Did you grow this thale cress?

458
33:34.665 --> 33:36.025
Keep this a secret.

459
33:38.905 --> 33:40.105
You can sit here.

460
33:53.945 --> 33:55.305
How far along are you?

461
33:55.385 --> 33:58.025
The presentation is done. Just the summary is left.

462
33:58.105 --> 33:59.785
I can do the summary.

463
33:59.865 --> 34:00.705
No need.

464
34:00.785 --> 34:03.065
Just translate and revise my paper.

465
34:03.145 --> 34:04.265
I will add your name

466
34:04.345 --> 34:06.465
to the microbiology assignment.

467
34:07.145 --> 34:08.865
Those are two different things.

468
34:09.465 --> 34:11.065
I'll finish the report in time.

469
34:11.145 --> 34:12.824
I won't take any advantage of you.

470
34:18.145 --> 34:20.225
Send me the information later.

471
34:20.304 --> 34:23.784
Click this link to see me writing the report in real time.

472
34:23.865 --> 34:25.985
If anything doesn't match, point it out.

473
34:27.465 --> 34:28.465
Why bother?

474
34:29.105 --> 34:32.145
It's no trouble. Everything should be clear.

475
34:32.225 --> 34:33.065
SEND

476
34:36.784 --> 34:38.025
These are my rates.

477
34:38.105 --> 34:40.945
Since you helped me change groups,

478
34:41.465 --> 34:42.865
I can give you a discount.

479
34:44.905 --> 34:47.025
Did you make this list just for me?

480
34:47.105 --> 34:48.225
It's my side gig.

481
34:49.905 --> 34:51.945
How many people have you sent it to?

482
34:52.025 --> 34:54.105
Has everyone in the college received it?

483
34:54.185 --> 34:57.505
I've sent it to our college and the College of Foreign Languages.

484
34:57.585 --> 35:00.225
Especially students doing English majors. My English is pretty good.

485
35:02.905 --> 35:03.985
English majors?

486
35:05.385 --> 35:08.385
Did you befriend that English major student at the cafeteria

487
35:08.465 --> 35:10.225
just to advertise yourself?

488
35:12.105 --> 35:13.225
Why else?

489
35:27.345 --> 35:29.185
ZHENG YU

490
35:39.185 --> 35:40.905
GOT IT

491
35:55.105 --> 35:56.545
WPS CLOUD DOCUMENT

492
35:59.705 --> 36:01.425
HUMAN ENDOGENOUS RETROVIRUSES…

493
36:06.305 --> 36:08.545
DYNAMIC EXPRESSION OF HUMAN ENDOGENOUS…

494
36:12.185 --> 36:17.665
SUMMARY OF RESULTS

495
36:33.705 --> 36:36.865
BASED ON THE DYNAMIC ACTIVATION PATTERN, VIRAL GENE ACTIVITY…

496
36:41.985 --> 36:43.025
CHEN YANZHOU

497
36:43.105 --> 36:47.105
NOT BAD.

498
36:57.065 --> 36:58.465
GOT IT.

499
37:22.145 --> 37:24.585
…CRUCIAL FOR UNDERSTANDING…

500
37:27.825 --> 37:29.225
…INDIVIDUAL GENETIC DIVERSITY…

501
37:34.665 --> 37:36.385
NOT EATING DINNER?

502
37:44.345 --> 37:45.985
It's divided into four stages.

503
37:46.065 --> 37:47.985
The first stage is uptake.

504
37:48.545 --> 37:51.265
Antigen-presenting cells, commonly known as APCs,

505
37:51.345 --> 37:53.705
use mechanisms like phagocytosis and pinocytosis

506
37:53.785 --> 37:55.785
to engulf extracellular antigens.

507
38:03.465 --> 38:05.185
LOOK UP

508
38:08.425 --> 38:09.985
The second stage is processing.

509
38:10.945 --> 38:14.225
After antigens in the body fuse with lysosomes.

510
38:14.305 --> 38:17.505
They are broken down into short peptides of 13 to 20 amino acids.

511
38:24.785 --> 38:27.705
Next group, Zheng Yu and Chen Yanzhou.

512
38:30.265 --> 38:33.105
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING

513
38:39.345 --> 38:42.145
Have you thought about where human genes come from?

514
38:43.225 --> 38:44.465
Your father or mother?

515
38:44.545 --> 38:46.585
Or maybe from an ancient virus.

516
38:46.665 --> 38:47.825
In 2016,

517
38:47.905 --> 38:50.665
researchers at the University of Michigan Medical School

518
38:50.745 --> 38:52.985
studied over 2500 human genomes.

519
38:53.065 --> 38:56.705
Thirty-six viral genes were found lurking in the human genome.

520
38:56.785 --> 39:00.665
Among them, 19 types were newly discovered and newly identified

521
39:00.745 --> 39:02.825
DNA fragments from viruses.

522
39:19.025 --> 39:21.385
FIRST SEMESTER ATTENDANCE SHEET

523
39:24.585 --> 39:26.705
35% OF WORKING PROFESSIONALS NEVER SWITCH PHONES OFF…

524
39:31.265 --> 39:32.985
-Registered for the cup yet? -No.

525
39:34.345 --> 39:35.545
Eight yuan.

526
39:35.625 --> 39:37.025
Everyone else has signed up.

527
39:37.105 --> 39:38.105
It costs 800 yuan.

528
39:38.185 --> 39:39.945
The collage will reimburse you

529
39:40.025 --> 39:41.785
if you get a ranking in the finals.

530
39:41.865 --> 39:43.585
There's also the prize money.

531
39:43.665 --> 39:44.505
And if I don't?

532
39:45.625 --> 39:46.945
So little confidence?

533
39:48.105 --> 39:49.305
Want to work with me?

534
39:52.705 --> 39:55.585
I'll pay the registration fee. It'll be reimbursed anyway.

535
39:56.225 --> 39:58.425
I want to free up time for my own research.

536
40:00.105 --> 40:01.025
Don't worry.

537
40:01.105 --> 40:03.425
You won't lose out by working with me.

538
40:03.505 --> 40:05.025
I won't hold you back.

539
40:05.105 --> 40:07.345
If I remember correctly,

540
40:07.425 --> 40:11.185
you just learned to put on rollerblades and move slowly.

541
40:14.665 --> 40:15.545
Excluding that.

542
40:16.505 --> 40:19.345
Besides, there are no group projects in that class.

543
40:19.425 --> 40:21.465
Even if I fail, it won't affect you.

544
40:22.065 --> 40:24.465
Others have been preparing for nearly two months.

545
40:24.545 --> 40:26.665
Isn't it too late for us to start now?

546
40:27.705 --> 40:29.385
I've already chosen a topic.

547
40:30.105 --> 40:31.865
Based on my understanding of you,

548
40:31.945 --> 40:32.785
the two of us

549
40:32.865 --> 40:35.345
will be able to keep up with each other.

550
40:36.065 --> 40:37.745
Registration will end soon.

551
40:38.505 --> 40:39.825
Do you dare to go for it?

552
40:40.545 --> 40:41.945
Your understanding of me?

553
40:42.505 --> 40:43.345
What do you know?

554
40:51.625 --> 40:52.625
I can agree to it,

555
40:52.705 --> 40:54.825
but you have to cover lab material costs

556
40:54.905 --> 40:56.385
during the competition.

557
40:57.305 --> 41:00.105
Also, I want to borrow two books from you.

558
41:00.705 --> 41:02.505
Consider it your show of good faith.

559
41:02.585 --> 41:04.585
Doesn't the library have those books?

560
41:04.665 --> 41:05.745
Anyway, you have them.

561
41:06.425 --> 41:07.305
How do you know?

562
41:07.385 --> 41:09.185
You brought them to the library.

563
41:11.105 --> 41:12.385
You peeked at my books?

564
41:31.225 --> 41:33.025
Rollerblading basics.

565
41:33.825 --> 41:35.985
Part one. The starting position.

566
41:36.505 --> 41:38.705
Have your feet shoulder-width apart

567
41:38.785 --> 41:41.945
with toes pointing slightly outward.

568
41:43.105 --> 41:44.705
Bend your knees forward

569
41:44.785 --> 41:46.105
but don't lock them.

570
41:46.185 --> 41:47.945
Lower your hips slightly.

571
41:50.065 --> 41:51.545
Here are the books you wanted.

572
42:12.705 --> 42:14.225
Use this to record later.

573
42:14.305 --> 42:16.625
It has the data from previous experiments.

574
42:20.185 --> 42:22.745
KEY EXPERIMENTAL METHODS TABLE OF EXPERIMENTAL DATA

575
42:22.825 --> 42:24.905
BASIC TECHNIQUES OF ROLLERBLADING

576
42:29.065 --> 42:30.105
What is it?

577
42:31.705 --> 42:32.865
Nothing.

578
42:41.505 --> 42:44.065
Since you carried all these books to campus,

579
42:44.145 --> 42:46.705
I'll give you a tip to pass the rollerblading exam.

580
42:48.825 --> 42:49.825
Do tell.

581
42:51.265 --> 42:54.945
Prepare a move that the teacher doesn't ask for and save it for last.

582
42:55.025 --> 42:56.865
It's okay if you haven't mastered it.

583
42:56.945 --> 43:00.785
An upperclassman said that the teacher will give extra points.

584
43:03.425 --> 43:04.505
Got it.

585
43:06.345 --> 43:07.385
Bye.

586
43:10.865 --> 43:12.545
-I'll buy you dinner. -No, thanks.

587
43:12.625 --> 43:14.465
See you at the lab this weekend.

588
43:19.065 --> 43:20.945
Guess you'll have to settle for me.

589
43:29.145 --> 43:30.345
So there's a chance.

590
43:32.985 --> 43:34.345
What are you talking about?

591
43:34.425 --> 43:35.265
You and Zheng Yu.

592
43:36.145 --> 43:39.225
I never expected you two to sign up for the Excellence Cup together.

593
43:40.225 --> 43:42.785
I originally didn't plan to compete together.

594
43:43.785 --> 43:45.385
What changed your mind?

595
43:46.065 --> 43:49.065
We worked together in microbiology, and it wasn't bad.

596
43:49.145 --> 43:52.385
I told you. You two just hadn't tried yet.

597
43:53.225 --> 43:54.345
But I'm curious.

598
43:54.425 --> 43:56.465
Which of you reached out first?

599
43:59.625 --> 44:01.345
Who reached out first?

600
44:04.065 --> 44:04.945
Who cares?

601
44:05.745 --> 44:06.665
I actually think

602
44:07.225 --> 44:08.985
you two are quite similar.

603
44:09.625 --> 44:12.465
You're both quite indifferent to others around you.

604
44:12.545 --> 44:14.865
But you hold nothing back in your studies.

605
44:14.945 --> 44:16.305
That enthusiasm is like

606
44:16.905 --> 44:18.385
a ball of fire in your hand.

607
44:19.505 --> 44:21.465
That absolute devotion gives others--

608
44:21.545 --> 44:22.905
Hot!

609
44:26.785 --> 44:29.905
I believe you two will get nice results.

610
44:31.505 --> 44:32.625
I sure hope so.

611
44:40.825 --> 44:42.185
I'm quite curious.

612
44:43.065 --> 44:45.385
Zheng Yu has good grades and capabilities.

613
44:45.465 --> 44:49.545
Why hasn't she ever joined a lab or done research?

614
44:50.145 --> 44:53.345
She always seems to be busy with unimportant things.

615
44:53.945 --> 44:55.225
Do you want to know?

616
44:56.465 --> 44:57.305
Ask her.

617
44:58.945 --> 45:01.545
That's how relationships are established.

618
45:02.145 --> 45:04.585
That's also how friends are made.

619
45:05.265 --> 45:06.225
Friends?

620
45:09.145 --> 45:10.905
We're just ordinary classmates.

621
45:17.345 --> 45:18.545
Thank you.

622
45:18.625 --> 45:19.545
Let's go.

623
45:32.505 --> 45:34.385
THE QING YI UNIVERSITY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY

624
45:37.505 --> 45:40.225
Why does this person look so familiar?

625
45:43.385 --> 45:45.585
STUDENT IDENTIFICATION CARD NAME: ZHOU GUANQI

626
45:45.665 --> 45:46.865
"Zhou Guanqi"?

627
46:10.185 --> 46:13.225
STUDENT IDENTIFICATION CARD

628
46:18.745 --> 46:19.705
CHEN YANZHOU, ZHOU GUANQI

629
46:19.785 --> 46:21.265
NO MATCHING SEARCH RESULTS

630
46:28.745 --> 46:29.665
ZHOU GUANQI, TOP SCHOLAR

631
46:29.745 --> 46:31.265
NO MATCHING SEARCH RESULTS

632
46:35.905 --> 46:37.665
ZHOU GUANQI

633
46:37.745 --> 46:38.745
QINGYI'S TOP SCHOLAR

634
46:40.825 --> 46:42.745
ZHOU GUANQI INTERVIEW: "I LOVE THIS CLUMP OF WEEDS"

635
46:43.745 --> 46:46.665
Okay, let's warm up with a few quick-fire questions.

636
46:46.745 --> 46:47.585
Age?

637
46:47.665 --> 46:48.505
Sixteen.

638
46:48.585 --> 46:49.745
Favorite color?

639
46:50.905 --> 46:51.985
It's hard to decide.

640
46:52.585 --> 46:53.945
Favorite place?

641
46:54.745 --> 46:56.425
Grassy places with many flowers.

642
46:56.505 --> 46:59.265
-Favorite dish? -Scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

643
46:59.345 --> 47:00.705
Favorite person?

644
47:01.305 --> 47:02.905
My family.

645
47:02.985 --> 47:05.385
What is the one thing you want to do most?

646
47:06.785 --> 47:09.105
-Let's move on to the next segment. -Okay.

647
47:09.185 --> 47:11.465
Let's move on to the main agenda.

648
47:11.545 --> 47:13.825
First, I'm dying to know this.

649
47:13.905 --> 47:16.825
You've accomplished being published in international journals in your teens.

650
47:16.905 --> 47:18.145
Is it because of passion?

651
47:18.225 --> 47:19.385
Passion?

652
47:20.665 --> 47:23.065
I think I'm far from that level.

653
47:24.985 --> 47:27.185
I guess it's fondness.

654
47:27.265 --> 47:29.345
I'm not intentionally or eagerly striving

655
47:29.425 --> 47:31.945
to achieve a particular outcome or result.

656
47:32.025 --> 47:34.385
Many things happen without you realizing

657
47:34.465 --> 47:36.225
in the process of liking something.

658
47:36.305 --> 47:38.265
For example, I learned calligraphy.

659
47:38.345 --> 47:40.545
Many asked me why I chose the Zhao style.

660
47:40.625 --> 47:42.785
I actually didn't think about it that much.

661
47:42.865 --> 47:44.585
It just looked nice to me,

662
47:44.665 --> 47:46.065
so I practiced for a while.

663
47:46.145 --> 47:47.305
It happened to suit me.

664
47:48.105 --> 47:49.225
If you say that,

665
47:49.305 --> 47:50.865
many people will be envious.

666
47:50.945 --> 47:52.225
I already am.

667
47:52.305 --> 47:53.705
That's such an exaggeration.

668
47:53.785 --> 47:55.625
Your parents must love you dearly.

669
47:55.705 --> 47:56.945
Of course.

670
47:57.025 --> 47:58.145
Especially Ms. Zhou.

671
47:58.225 --> 47:59.065
Ms. Zhou?

672
48:00.265 --> 48:02.665
I'm used to calling my mother Ms. Zhou.

673
48:02.745 --> 48:05.545
She's a very outstanding environmental engineer.

674
48:06.265 --> 48:07.465
I have received

675
48:07.545 --> 48:10.185
a lot of support and love from her.

676
48:10.265 --> 48:13.065
Ms. Zhou sounds like a very…

677
