Hello. You must be Yanzhou.

685
48:35.905 --> 48:38.185
We had heard that Guanqi has a brother.

686
48:38.265 --> 48:39.825
Can you chat with us?

687
48:40.465 --> 48:41.505
No.

688
48:42.265 --> 48:43.105
Sorry.

689
48:45.985 --> 48:46.825
No.

690
48:46.905 --> 48:48.825
INTERVIEW WITH 16-YEAR-OLD GENIUS ZHOU GUANQI

